[Challenges: Active Trade-offs]
  @note Design intersections requiring deliberate decisions. Not bugs, not tasks.

  - INVESTIGATING(fd_write_loop_placement): host simplicity vs trap overhead
      host_loop: +code_size, −traps | shim_loop: −code_size, +traps
      direction: shim-first, pivot on benchmark
      @see challenge.md §1
  - ABSORBED(syscall_memory_safety): unified vMMIO permission table IS the validation
      vMMIO permission check = vsoc_validate_ptr. No separate mechanism.
      Permitted addresses: zero-cost direct access. Unpermitted: reject.
      @see challenge.md §2, runtime_vmmio.md §1
  - DECIDED(csp_handoff): direct switch + approximate yield as starvation mitigation
      formal_verified: ipc_handoff.tla ✓
      @see challenge.md §4
  - INVESTIGATING(blocked_list_cost): RAM cost of next_blocked pointer vs scheduling efficiency
      direction: single linked list + INTERRUPTED flag (deferred unlink)
      @see challenge.md §3

